(================================================================================) Tj T*
(COMPREHENSIVE FORMULAS & FUNCTIONS HANDBOOK [EXCEL & GOOGLE SHEETS]) Tj T*
(================================================================================) Tj T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.10 0.35 0.65 rg
(PART 1: FORMULA BASICS, OPERATORS & CELL REFERENCING) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(1. FORMULA SYNTAX RULES:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - Every formula and function MUST start with an equals sign \(=\).) Tj T*
(   - Functions follow the pattern: =FUNCTION_NAME\(argument1, argument2, ...\)) Tj T*
(   - Arguments are separated by commas \(,\).) Tj T*
(   - Text strings inside formulas must be wrapped in quotes: "Delayed".) Tj T*
(   - Numerical values and cell references do NOT use quotes: A1 + 50.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(2. ARITHMETIC OPERATORS & PEMDAS PRECEDENCE:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   +  Addition          =A1 + B1) Tj T*
(   -  Subtraction       =A1 - B1) Tj T*
(   *  Multiplication    =A1 * B1) Tj T*
(   /  Division          =A1 / B1) Tj T*
(   ^  Exponentiation    =A1 ^ 2   \(A1 squared\)) Tj T*
(   %  Percentage        =A1 * 18% \(Multiplies by 0.18\)) Tj T*
(   \(\) Parentheses       Controls calculation order: =\(A1 + B1\) * C1) Tj T*
(   * PEMDAS Order: Parentheses -> Exponents -> Multiply/Divide -> Add/Subtract) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(3. CELL REFERENCING TYPES \(CRITICAL LAB & EXAM SKILL\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - Relative Reference \(A1\):) Tj T*
(     Shifts row and column automatically when copied or dragged.) Tj T*
(     Example: In C1, =A1*B1. Dragged down to C2 automatically becomes =A2*B2.) Tj T*
(   - Absolute Reference \($A$1\):) Tj T*
(     Locks BOTH column and row with $. Never shifts when copied anywhere.) Tj T*
(     Shortcut Key: Press F4 \(or Fn + F4\) while editing a cell reference.) Tj T*
(     Example: =B2 * $D$1 \(where D1 holds a fixed Tax Rate or Aviation Fuel Surcharge\).) Tj T*
(   - Mixed Reference \($A1 or A$1\):) Tj T*
(     $A1 locks Column A, while row changes when dragged down.) Tj T*
(     A$1 locks Row 1, while column changes when dragged across.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(4. ERROR CODES & DIAGNOSTIC FIXES:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - #DIV/0!  : Attempted division by zero or empty cell. Fix: Wrap in IFERROR.) Tj T*
(   - #N/A     : Value not available \(Lookup found no matching record\).) Tj T*
(   - #VALUE!  : Wrong data type passed \(e.g. attempting arithmetic on text\).) Tj T*
(   - #REF!    : Invalid cell reference \(a referenced row or column was deleted\).) Tj T*
(   - #NAME?   : Misspelled function name \(e.g. =SUMM\(A1:A10\) instead of =SUM\).) Tj T*
(   - ####     : Column is too narrow to display number. Fix: Double-click header.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.10 0.35 0.65 rg
(PART 2: ESSENTIAL STATISTICAL FUNCTIONS:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   =SUM\(range\)          : Adds all numbers in range        =SUM\(H2:H51\)) Tj T*
(   =AVERAGE\(range\)      : Calculates arithmetic mean       =AVERAGE\(L2:L51\)) Tj T*
(   =MIN\(range\)          : Returns smallest value in range  =MIN\(I2:I51\)) Tj T*
(   =MAX\(range\)          : Returns largest value in range   =MAX\(I2:I51\)) Tj T*
(   =COUNT\(range\)        : Counts cells with NUMBERS only   =COUNT\(L2:L51\)) Tj T*
(   =COUNTA\(range\)       : Counts all NON-EMPTY cells       =COUNTA\(A2:A51\)) Tj T*
(   =COUNTBLANK\(range\)   : Counts empty cells in range      =COUNTBLANK\(M2:M51\)) Tj T*
(   =ROUND\(num, digits\)  : Rounds to specified decimals     =ROUND\(A1, 1\)) Tj T*
(   =MOD\(num, divisor\)   : Returns division remainder       =MOD\(125, 60\) -> 5) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
