0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(COMPARISON OPERATORS:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(= \(Equal\), <> \(Not Equal\), > \(Greater Than\), < \(Less Than\), >= \(GTE\), <= \(LTE\)) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(1. IF FUNCTION \(BINARY DECISION\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =IF\(logical_test, value_if_true, value_if_false\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =IF\(L2 > 15, "Delayed", "On-Time"\)) Tj T*
(   Evaluates flight delay: if L2 > 15 returns "Delayed", else "On-Time".) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(2. NESTED IF \(MULTI-TIER DECISION HIERARCHY\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =IF\(cond1, val1, IF\(cond2, val2, val3\)\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =IF\(L2=0, "On-Time", IF\(L2<=30, "Minor Delay", "Major Disruption"\)\)) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(3. IFS FUNCTION \(MODERN CLEAN MULTI-CONDITION SYNTAX\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =IFS\(condition1, val1, condition2, val2, [TRUE, default_val]\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =IFS\(L2=0, "On-Time", L2<=15, "Short Buffer", TRUE, "Delayed"\)) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(4. LOGICAL OPERATORS: AND, OR, NOT) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - =AND\(cond1, cond2\): Returns TRUE only if ALL conditions are TRUE.) Tj T*
(     Example: =IF\(AND\(F2="International", I2>250\), "Widebody Gate", "Narrowbody"\)) Tj T*
(   - =OR\(cond1, cond2\): Returns TRUE if AT LEAST ONE condition is TRUE.) Tj T*
(     Example: =IF\(OR\(K2="Delayed", K2="Cancelled"\), "Irregular Ops", "Normal"\)) Tj T*
(   - =NOT\(cond\): Reverses boolean truth value.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(5. ERROR SUPPRESSION: IFERROR & IFNA) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =IFERROR\(calculation, fallback_value\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =IFERROR\(I2 / H2, 0\)  -> Prevents #DIV/0! if capacity is empty.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.10 0.35 0.65 rg
(PART 4: CRITERIA-BASED AGGREGATIONS \(COUNTIF, SUMIF, AVERAGEIF\)) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(1. COUNTIF & COUNTIFS:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - Single Condition: =COUNTIF\(range, criteria\)) Tj T*
(     Example: =COUNTIF\(B2:B51, "IndiGo"\)            -> Counts IndiGo movements) Tj T*
(     Example: =COUNTIF\(L2:L51, ">30"\)                -> Flights delayed >30 mins) Tj T*
(   - Multiple Conditions: =COUNTIFS\(criteria_range1, crit1, crit_range2, crit2\)) Tj T*
(     Example: =COUNTIFS\(B2:B51, "Air India", K2:K51, "Delayed"\)) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(2. SUMIF & SUMIFS:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - Single Condition: =SUMIF\(criteria_range, criteria, [sum_range]\)) Tj T*
(     Example: =SUMIF\(C2:C51, "T1", J2:J51\)          -> Sums baggage pieces for T1) Tj T*
(   - Multiple Conditions: =SUMIFS\(sum_range, crit_range1, crit1, crit_range2, crit2\)) Tj T*
(     * CRITICAL: In SUMIFS, sum_range comes FIRST, not last!) Tj T*
(     Example: =SUMIFS\(I2:I51, B2:B51, "IndiGo", C2:C51, "T1"\)) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(3. AVERAGEIF & AVERAGEIFS:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - Single Condition: =AVERAGEIF\(criteria_range, criteria, [avg_range]\)) Tj T*
(     Example: =AVERAGEIF\(B2:B51, "Vistara", L2:L51\)  -> Avg delay for Vistara) Tj T*
(   - Multiple Conditions: =AVERAGEIFS\(avg_range, crit_range1, crit1, ...\)) Tj T*
(     Example: =AVERAGEIFS\(L2:L51, C2:C51, "T2", F2:F51, "International"\)) Tj
ET
endstream
