(PART 5: TEXT MANIPULATION & DATA CLEANING FUNCTIONS) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(FUNCTION          SYNTAX & DESCRIPTION                        EXAMPLE) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(& \(Ampersand\)    Concatenation operator                      =A2 & " - " & D2) Tj T*
(                 Joins text without a formula.               -> "FL-101 - BLR-DEL") Tj T*
(CONCATENATE      =CONCATENATE\(text1, text2, ...\)             =CONCATENATE\(B2, " ", C2\)) Tj T*
(TEXTJOIN         =TEXTJOIN\(delim, ignore_empty, range\)       =TEXTJOIN\(", ", TRUE, B2:B6\)) Tj T*
(                 Joins array with a custom delimiter.        -> "IndiGo, Air India") Tj T*
(UPPER            =UPPER\(text\)                                =UPPER\("spicejet"\) -> "SPICEJET") Tj T*
(LOWER            =LOWER\(text\)                                =LOWER\("AIR INDIA"\) -> "air india") Tj T*
(PROPER           =PROPER\(text\)                               =PROPER\("akasa air"\) -> "Akasa Air") Tj T*
(TRIM             =TRIM\(text\)                                 =TRIM\("  BLR  "\) -> "BLR") Tj T*
(                 Removes extra leading & trailing spaces.) Tj T*
(LEN              =LEN\(text\)                                  =LEN\("FL-101"\) -> 6) Tj T*
(                 Counts total character count in cell.) Tj T*
(LEFT             =LEFT\(text, num_chars\)                      =LEFT\("BLR-BOM", 3\) -> "BLR") Tj T*
(                 Extracts n characters from the left.) Tj T*
(RIGHT            =RIGHT\(text, num_chars\)                     =RIGHT\("BLR-BOM", 3\) -> "BOM") Tj T*
(                 Extracts n characters from the right.) Tj T*
(MID              =MID\(text, start_num, num_chars\)            =MID\("FL-101", 4, 3\) -> "101") Tj T*
(                 Extracts characters from the middle.) Tj T*
(FIND             =FIND\(find_text, within_text\)               =FIND\("-", "BLR-DEL"\) -> 4) Tj T*
(                 Returns character position \(Case-Sensitive\).) Tj T*
(SEARCH           =SEARCH\(find_text, within_text\)             Case-insensitive position search.) Tj T*
(SUBSTITUTE       =SUBSTITUTE\(text, old, new\)                 =SUBSTITUTE\("T1", "1", "2"\) -> "T2") Tj T*
(TEXT             =TEXT\(value, format_string\)                 =TEXT\(TODAY\(\), "DD-MMM-YYYY"\)) Tj T*
(                 Converts numbers/dates to text display.     =TEXT\(1250, "#,##0"\) -> "1,250") Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.10 0.35 0.65 rg
(PART 6: LOOKUP & REFERENCE FUNCTIONS) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(1. VLOOKUP \(VERTICAL LOOKUP - TRADITIONAL STANDARD\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =VLOOKUP\(lookup_value, table_array, col_index_num, [range_lookup]\)) Tj T*
(   - lookup_value  : Value to search for \(MUST reside in Column 1 of table\).) Tj T*
(   - table_array   : The data range holding the lookup table \(e.g. A2:M51\).) Tj T*
(   - col_index_num : Column number to return data from \(e.g. 2 for Airline\).) Tj T*
(   - [range_lookup]: ALWAYS specify FALSE \(or 0\) for exact match!) Tj T*
(   Example: =VLOOKUP\("FL-105", A2:M51, 2, FALSE\)) Tj T*
(   * Limitation: VLOOKUP CANNOT look to the left of the lookup column!) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(2. INDEX + MATCH \(THE TWO-WAY LOOKUP GOLD STANDARD\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - =MATCH\(lookup_val, lookup_range, 0\) : Returns the exact row position index.) Tj T*
(   - =INDEX\(return_range, row_num\)       : Retrieves data from that row index.) Tj T*
(   Combined Formula:) Tj T*
(   =INDEX\(B2:B51, MATCH\("FL-105", A2:A51, 0\)\)) Tj T*
(   * Superpower: Can look left or right, and never breaks when columns are added!) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(3. XLOOKUP \(MODERN STANDARD IN EXCEL 365 & GOOGLE SHEETS\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =XLOOKUP\(lookup_val, lookup_range, return_range, [if_not_found]\)) Tj T*
(   - Defaults to EXACT MATCH automatically \(no FALSE needed!\).) Tj T*
(   - Built-in error handling via [if_not_found] argument.) Tj T*
(   Example: =XLOOKUP\("FL-105", A2:A51, B2:B51, "Flight Not Found"\)) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
