(PART 7: DATE & TIME FUNCTIONS) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(FUNCTION          SYNTAX & DESCRIPTION                        EXAMPLE) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(TODAY\(\)         =TODAY\(\)                                   Returns current system date.) Tj T*
(NOW\(\)           =NOW\(\)                                     Returns current date and time.) Tj T*
(DATE            =DATE\(year, month, day\)                    =DATE\(2026, 10, 24\)) Tj T*
(YEAR            =YEAR\(serial_date\)                         =YEAR\(TODAY\(\)\) -> 2026) Tj T*
(MONTH           =MONTH\(serial_date\)                        =MONTH\(TODAY\(\)\) -> 10) Tj T*
(DAY             =DAY\(serial_date\)                          =DAY\(TODAY\(\)\) -> 24) Tj T*
(HOUR            =HOUR\(time_val\)                            =HOUR\(NOW\(\)\) -> 13) Tj T*
(MINUTE          =MINUTE\(time_val\)                          =MINUTE\(NOW\(\)\) -> 45) Tj T*
(DATEDIF         =DATEDIF\(start_date, end_date, unit\)       =DATEDIF\(A2, B2, "D"\)) Tj T*
(                 Units: "Y" \(years\), "M" \(months\), "D" \(days\).) Tj T*
(NETWORKDAYS     =NETWORKDAYS\(start_date, end_date, [hols]\) Calculates working business days.) Tj T*
(EDATE           =EDATE\(start_date, months\)                 Adds or subtracts n months.) Tj T*
(EOMONTH         =EOMONTH\(start_date, months\)               Returns last day of the month.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.10 0.35 0.65 rg
(PART 8: GOOGLE SHEETS DYNAMIC ARRAY SUPERPOWERS) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(1. UNIQUE FUNCTION \(AUTOMATIC DEDUPLICATION\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =UNIQUE\(range\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =UNIQUE\(B2:B51\)) Tj T*
(   Spills a clean, distinct list of unique airlines automatically without duplicates!) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(2. SORT FUNCTION \(DYNAMIC TABLE SORTING\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =SORT\(range, sort_column_index, is_ascending\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =SORT\(A2:M51, 12, FALSE\)) Tj T*
(   Dynamically sorts entire flight dataset by Delay_Mins \(Col 12\) descending.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(3. FILTER FUNCTION \(DYNAMIC LIVE SUBSETS\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =FILTER\(range, condition1, [condition2, ...]\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =FILTER\(A2:M51, K2:K51="Delayed", C2:C51="T1"\)) Tj T*
(   Extracts all delayed T1 flights into an adjacent table with zero manual work.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(4. ARRAYFORMULA \(ELIMINATES MANUAL FORMULA DRAGGING\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =ARRAYFORMULA\(formula_applied_to_range\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =ARRAYFORMULA\(I2:I51 / H2:H51 * 100\)) Tj T*
(   Computes Load Factor across all 50 rows in one single formula cell!) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(5. QUERY FUNCTION \(SQL DATABASE QUERIES INSIDE SPREADSHEETS\):) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   Syntax: =QUERY\(data, "SELECT ... WHERE ... GROUP BY ..."\)) Tj T*
(   Example: =QUERY\(A1:M51, "SELECT B, SUM\(I\) WHERE C='T1' GROUP BY B"\)) Tj T*
(   Executes full database aggregations natively in Google Sheets.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 7.8 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(6. SPARKLINE & IMPORTRANGE:) Tj T*
/F3 7.8 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(   - =SPARKLINE\(range, {"charttype","bar"}\) : Miniature in-cell chart.) Tj T*
(   - =IMPORTRANGE\("sheet_url", "Raw_Data!A1:M50"\) : Live cross-sheet data sync.) Tj
ET
